I think that I might have come across a minor bug in nethack 3.0pl10.
I encountered the oracle twice in one game. I found it once on dlvl 7,
and then again in a bones level on dlvl 8 from one of my former games.
I assume that one is never supposed to meet it more than once. (On
similar lines, I'm thinking it could be possible to meet the Medusa
more than once due to a bones level?)

